#  This file is part of the shipped tree and is covered by the
#  installer/updater coherence check (every shipped file must be
#  in the integrity filelist).
#
#  Keep this list in sync with the optional-packages table in
#  README.md, INSTALL.md and INSTALL_MANUAL.md.
# ==========================================================

